{"pageProps":{"data":{"news_id":"663","news_catgory":"0","hot_news":"0","news_push":"","news_on_top":"1","news_title":"陸廠壓境 不銹鋼業拉警報","news_summary":"","image_path":"","news_content":"<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; outline: none !important; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">2019-06-17 00:47</span><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: none !important; margin: 0px; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">經濟日報 記者林政鋒／高雄報導</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; outline: none !important; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; text-align: center;\\\"><img alt=\\\"\\\" src=\\\"http://www.stspcsr.com.tw/user_files/photo%20(1).jpg\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px; vertical-align: middle; width: 800px; height: 427px;\\\" /><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\"><font color=\\\"#000000\\\" size=\\\"3\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">報</font></span><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\"><font color=\\\"#000000\\\" size=\\\"3\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">系資料照</font></span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; text-align: center;\\\"><img alt=\\\"\\\" src=\\\"http://www.stspcsr.com.tw/user_files/photo%20(2).jpg\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px; vertical-align: middle; width: 400px; height: 237px;\\\" /></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\"><font color=\\\"#000000\\\" size=\\\"3\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">經濟日報提供</font></span></p>\n\n<hr style=\\\"box-sizing: content-box; height: 1px; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; border: 0px; background-image: -webkit-linear-gradient(left, transparent, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2), transparent); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\" />\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif; font-size: 16pt;\\\">台灣不銹鋼廢料<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">4</span>月出口突然暴增六成，其中逾半數出口至印尼，市場推測在印尼設有煉軋一貫廠的陸資青山集團大買國內不銹鋼廢料，意圖從最上游墊高廢料成本，施壓國內燁聯、唐榮、華新麗華等煉鋼廠，迫使台灣鋼廠必須仰賴青山供貨半成品，不銹鋼產業鏈飽受外力攻擊，戰情日益吃緊。</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif; font-size: 16pt;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif; font-size: 16pt;\\\">不銹鋼冶煉過程除了需要投料鎳之外，還有不銹鋼廢料，成本不低。不銹鋼專家說，青山集團已在台灣布建通路，大肆收購國內不銹鋼廢料，由於上游煉鋼廠燁聯、唐榮、華新麗華等都以電爐煉鋼，深度仰賴廢鋼料源，青山等同直接向台灣不銹鋼產業下重手，但是在自由交易前提下，相關鋼廠很難有抵抗能力，產業結構受到威脅。</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif; font-size: 16pt;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif; font-size: 16pt;\\\">上市不銹鋼廠主管表示，根據海關資料統計，今年<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">4</span>月台灣不銹鋼出口總量<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">5,370</span>公噸，為今年最大出口量，比<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">3</span>月的<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">3,386</span>公噸大增<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">59%</span>，<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">4</span>月銷往印尼的不銹鋼廢鋼<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">2,898</span>公噸，占當月出口量<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">54%</span>。業者說，從資料上看不出買家是誰，但當地也僅有青山是具規模大廠。</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif; font-size: 16pt;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif; font-size: 16pt;\\\">值得注意的是，今年<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">1</span>月至<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">3</span>月，台灣銷往印尼的不銹鋼廢料都掛零，<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">4</span>月突然暴增占總出口半數以上。另印尼是鎳礦產區，理論上對不銹鋼廢鋼的依賴性很低，如今卻反其道大買台灣不銹鋼廢鋼，明顯有高度策略意涵，國內上游廠憂心忡忡。</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif; font-size: 16pt;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif; font-size: 16pt;\\\">燁聯與唐榮主管說，全球不銹鋼巨鱷青山集團在印尼鎳礦產區設一貫作業煉鋼廠，由於接近料源，加上導入先進鎳生鐵製程，生產成本大幅降低，展現強大競爭優勢，台灣不銹鋼從上游煉鋼到中游軋鋼及下游成品廠，大肆從青山購半成品，導致煉鋼廠淪為軋鋼廠、軋鋼廠變裁剪廠，台灣不銹鋼中上游製程設備稼動率持續降低，整個產業已經被青山集團控制。據了解，青山從印尼煉軋後的半成品每噸成本低於本土鋼廠約<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">200</span>美元，換算新台幣<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px;\\\">6,000</span>多元。</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif; font-size: 16pt;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif; font-size: 16pt;\\\">如今青山集團進一步在台南、高雄設收購據點，大力蒐羅台灣不銹鋼廢料，立即拉抬國內不銹鋼廢料價格，上游煉鋼廠成本持續增加，產品競爭力則不斷弱化，直擊華新麗華、唐榮、燁聯等煉鋼廠要害，煉鋼綜效不符成本，更依賴向青山採購半成品（熱捲），陷入惡性循環難以自拔。</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif; font-size: 16pt;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decorati